# Folders on the Cheats screen (source/screens/cheats.c,
# docs/plans/cheat-folders.md) over tests/shots/data/folders.cht: the Items
# and Wild cheats fold into one row each, named by their folder, how many
# are on (Items) or how many it holds (Wild) at the right; the cursor on
# Items (list); A opens it: its cheats without the "Items: " prefix, the
# Item x99 variants folded into one choice row, the folder's name in the
# title (folder); A picks Master Ball beside Rare Candy (picked); A on the
# choice row opens its choices within the folder (choices); B back in the
# folder (infolder), B again on Items' row, "2 on" (back). The title names
# where the list is, the place one up faint after it. Starter, one run of
# variants, opens straight to its choices (direct); A on Torchic picks it
# and goes back to the top, Torchic at Starter's right (chosen). A folder
# whose name is too long for the title: cut at first (long), then scrolled
# to its end once the cursor has rested (scrolled).
#! settings 28=1
#! sd-file /torii/cheats/Hello.cht 0 tests/shots/data/folders.cht
# The tests' hook: lists open on their first row (else a list opens on
# Hello, the game Recent played last)
-p 30:nav_test_action:2113929225
-w "nav: test hook 9 "
-w "nav: home ready"
-k @8:RIGHT -k @12:-
-k @20:A -k @24:-
-w "nav: page gba ready"
-k @8:RIGHT -k @12:- -k @20:RIGHT -k @24:- -k @32:RIGHT -k @36:-
-k @80:START -k @84:-
-w "screen ready: game-popup"
-k @12:DOWN -k @16:- -k @24:DOWN -k @28:-
-k @48:A -k @52:-
-w "screen ready: cheats"
-k @16:DOWN -k @20:-
-s @32:list.png
-k @40:A -k @44:-
-s @64:folder.png
-k @72:A -k @76:-
-s @92:picked.png
-k @100:DOWN -k @104:- -k @112:A -k @116:-
-s @140:choices.png
-k @148:B -k @154:-
-s @176:infolder.png
-k @184:B -k @190:-
-s @212:back.png
-k @220:DOWN -k @224:- -k @232:DOWN -k @236:- -k @244:A -k @248:-
-s @272:direct.png
-k @280:DOWN -k @284:- -k @292:A -k @296:-
-s @320:chosen.png
-k @328:DOWN -k @332:- -k @340:A -k @344:-
-s @364:long.png
-s @480:scrolled.png
